# Redirects for Cloudflare Pages
#
# This is a multi-page STATIC Astro build, not a SPA. Do not add a
# "/*  /index.html  200" catch-all: that served the homepage with HTTP 200 for
# every unmatched path, so nonexistent URLs never returned a 404. Search
# engines treat those as soft 404s and index them. Astro emits a real 404 page
# and Pages serves static assets before consulting this file.

# /portfolio was retired when the site moved to the single-page dashboards and
# automations layout. It was an indexed URL, so it redirects rather than 404s:
# a 301 passes its ranking signals to the homepage and keeps old links working.
/portfolio  /  301
/portfolio/*  /  301
